{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>My Pet Fan</strong> is a fun game where you can raise <i>your own Fan</i> from Inanimate Insanity!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Feed him, pet him, play games with him or just let him sleep! Whatever you want to do, Fan will always be there for you ready to play and have fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can also customize him using custom skins! Such as Watermelon Fan, Bowtie Fan, and many more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Best part is, this game is <strong>ENTIRELY</strong> free! No funky in-game purchases and it's free to play too!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We're currently in closed early access! You can request to join the beta by clicking the button above.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613470/extras/fan2.png?t=1744052050\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">NOTE: Fan is a character by AnimationEpic, and all rights to it are owned by them. We do not profit off of this game.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3613470?t=1744052050","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613470/837d646f42eb9b4f2b58b2d33199e058f6b717ee/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744052050","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613470/40e2bd28072a1f4608960066018b9619d653e0b7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744052050","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613470/40e2bd28072a1f4608960066018b9619d653e0b7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744052050","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class